cess can use this application as part of their required hands-on VR training.", "short_description": "HVAC Boiler Inspection & Maintenance is the VR hands-on training application for the ImmerseLearn HVAC Boiler Inspection & Maintenance Micro-Credential Program. This application is intended exclusively for enrolled learners and provides immersive, real-world practice in boiler inspection, preventive maintenance, safety procedures, and troubleshooting. Access is available only to users enrolled in the ImmerseLearn program."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://immerselearn.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ImmerseLearn", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://immerselearn.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1632742492185889"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1044180041600729"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1044180041600729"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1783925820, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1044180041600729"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1700461932080611", "version": "2.1"}, "id": "1526289348977855", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binar